{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Manage player characters: create (quick or step-by-step), stage to roster, import, render a sheet, set the active entity, set personality/voice, patch mechanical stats, send player signals, remove, or list roster characters. sheet and roster_list are read-only; Novel mutations persist, are audited, and are undoable via manage_history (action: undo). update merges provided fields in place (stats shallow-merge; omitted fields are preserved) so one sheet field can change without re-creating the character. The personality{} object aliases description/voice/background/goals, and details{} aliases ability_scores/skills/feats/talents/equipment; a top-level value overrides its grouped alias. stage and roster_remove are exact inverses on the roster; remove deletes the Novel entity and is undoable. Use when: creating or importing a PC, staging or activating one for play, editing its sheet or voice, or handling player feedback. Do NOT use when: managing an NPC \u2014 use manage_npc.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"ability_scores":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"items":{"type":"number"},"type":"array"}],"description":"Ability scores (create)."},"action":{"description":"create, stage, import, sheet, set_active, personality, voice, signal, update, remove, roster_remove, or roster_list.","enum":["create","stage","import","sheet","set_active","personality","voice","signal","update","remove","roster_remove","roster_list"],"type":"string"},"background":{"description":"Backstory (create/personality).","type":"string"},"classes":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"items":{"properties":{"className":{"type":"string"},"levels":{"type":"number"}},"required":["className"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"}],"description":"Class levels (create)."},"description":{"description":"Narrative descri